# Copy to deploy/.env (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit the filled-in file.
PRACTICEHUB_SECRET=            # HMAC key for track signatures: `python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"`
KEYCLOAK_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
# KEYCLOAK_URL=http://keycloak:8180
# KEYCLOAK_REALM=practice
# KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_SECRET=
OPENFGA_DB_PASSWORD=
OPENFGA_TOKEN=
# OPENFGA_URL=http://openfga:8080   # after `practicehub openfga init --url http://openfga:8080`
LITELLM_API_KEY=
# LITELLM_URL=http://litellm:4000
LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=
LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=
LANGFUSE_HOST=
# MEDPLUM_URL=https://medplum.example.ca/fhir/R4/
# MEDPLUM_CLIENT_ID=
# MEDPLUM_CLIENT_SECRET=
# PRACTICEHUB_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_MODELS=1   # only if the practice has decided data may leave the premises
# The model a new agent is given when it names none (written into its profile when it is added; the default is a
# local Ollama model). Ollama is reached at OLLAMA_URL.
# PRACTICEHUB_DEFAULT_MODEL=ollama/qwen3.5:4b
# OLLAMA_URL=http://host.docker.internal:11434
# OLLAMA_NUM_CTX=32768                 # the context window every call to Ollama asks for
# OLLAMA_THINK=1                      # a model that thinks does so before it answers (off by default)
# Its thinking is shown as it comes, in the record's History and in the chat; thinking that goes round in a loop
# (the same passage said over and over) stops the call.
# The hub sets no temperature: each model keeps the sampling it ships with (`ollama show <model> --parameters`).
# On a small GPU, start the Ollama server itself (not the hub) with OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE=q8_0: an 8-bit context
# cache is half the size, so more of the model stays on the GPU (docs/getting-started.md, step 6).
# Office documents with Collabora Online (docker compose --profile office): the browser's URL for Collabora, the
# hub's own URL as Collabora reaches it, and where the hub reads Collabora's discovery.
# PRACTICEHUB_COLLABORA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9981
# PRACTICEHUB_WOPI_BASE=http://hub:8200
# PRACTICEHUB_COLLABORA_DISCOVERY_URL=http://collabora:9980
